9:["$","div",null,{"className":"method-grid","children":[["$","div","Workflow decomposition",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Workflow decomposition"}],[["$","p","Valuation and M&A advisory work was decomposed into conversation, task, work, and research agents with an explicit assumption layer. The orchestrator routed bounded tasks, retained intermediate artifacts, and could reassign failed steps rather than restart an entire document.",{"children":"Valuation and M&A advisory work was decomposed into conversation, task, work, and research agents with an explicit assumption layer. The orchestrator routed bounded tasks, retained intermediate artifacts, and could reassign failed steps rather than restart an entire document."}],["$","p","This made the unit of recovery smaller than the final workbook or presentation. A user revision could target one assumption, table, or slide while preserving upstream evidence and unaffected outputs.",{"children":"This made the unit of recovery smaller than the final workbook or presentation. A user revision could target one assumption, table, or slide while preserving upstream evidence and unaffected outputs."}]]]}],["$","div","Evidence to editable output",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Evidence to editable output"}],[["$","p","Purpose-built tools collected and parsed DART, KRX, and web sources. Structured values were normalized separately from embedded narrative material, then retrieved only for the active task to reduce irrelevant context.",{"children":"Purpose-built tools collected and parsed DART, KRX, and web sources. Structured values were normalized separately from embedded narrative material, then retrieved only for the active task to reduce irrelevant context."}],["$","p","The production workflow generated workbooks with more than 30 sheets and presentations with roughly 200 slides in about five minutes, after which individual edits were applied within seconds. These figures describe the role period, not a public benchmark or a guarantee for other workloads.",{"children":"The production workflow generated workbooks with more than 30 sheets and presentations with roughly 200 slides in about five minutes, after which individual edits were applied within seconds. These figures describe the role period, not a public benchmark or a guarantee for other workloads."}]]]}]]}]
